A member may appeal a declined claim or a declined pre-authorisation within
ninety days of the date of the decision letter. ## Declined requests Proceeding with treatment
after a request has been declined means the full cost is borne by the member;

Physiotherapy is limited to twenty sessions per policy year under the Essential
plan. Sessions delivered during an inpatient admission are not counted against
this limit. Vision cover is limited to one refraction test per policy year;
